    "title": "Lincoln Riley, USC offense moving towards different identity - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By R.J. Abeytia ,\n1 days ago As good as USC has been on offense, it hasn't always been able to beat teams the way so many great Trojans teams could. We've said it for years. Sooner or later, great teams have to be able run it even when the other team knows it's going to run the ball. USC has not been that team under Lincoln Riley, but there's a growing sentiment from the team they are on their way to becoming that team. Read full article\n2",
